{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "df391400a6652477791e4d4a95683e2e514280adb6436c030f646d65fe3f20d6", "ja": "おふたりとも、大変です！　机に置いておいた本が、\n消えてしまいました！　これは……まさか、神隠し！？", "zh": "两位，不好了！放在桌上的书，\n不见了！难道……这是神隐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "ce3a69c55918d66fe4f5fec5a1f85eedac6c04a54591a9a872399835a763abad", "ja": "だったら、面白そうだけど……たぶん、\nどこかに片付けられちゃっただけじゃない？", "zh": "如果真是那样，听起来倒是挺有意思……不过，应该只是被收拾到什么地方去了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "1b0ce32b78fc8945ece217dd136ff74d06d2905c8f3c4baa4c056d0a338aa1e6", "ja": "そ、そういえば……さっきまで、\n美咲さんが控え室の片付けをしてくれてました……。", "zh": "这、这么说来……刚才，美咲小姐还在帮忙整理休息室……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "9848031fa627cbbcd82583a1342498bae7f22739b86be9a362cc5819c8be1ac6", "ja": "本は、まとめて資料室に持っていくって……\nも、もしかしたら、そっちにあるのかも……？", "zh": "书、书说要集中搬到资料室去……\n说、说不定就在那边……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "4b7cde6c9c553c6c9afd86d42bd10f41e1f4bc538eb0a6a32f1794b687e558a8", "ja": "なるほど、資料室ですね！\n私、取りに行ってきます！", "zh": "原来如此，是资料室啊！\n我这就去拿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "f491823474c204f8a83fd0f235f40b99a5c59a2f96ced69de842b47de7f16390", "ja": "待って、百合子。私も行くわ。", "zh": "等等，百合子。我也去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "1f854cc225ca2b5bf47954323c5aaf49579450f1db47030c027d423be5478cb3", "ja": "わ……私も、一緒に、探します……！", "zh": "我……我也会一起找……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1008_p", "source_sha256": "578428df54f5cf38114033f07bc14b16af71c1f6ac26642f837a8215495a6020", "ja": "（新しい曲のデモが届いた。今回の曲は、百合子に\n歌ってもらおうと思ってるけど……どこにいるかな？）", "zh": "（新歌的试听样曲送到了。这次的歌，我想让百合子来唱……她在哪儿呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1009_p", "source_sha256": "189da799278258d02426e498acb2d1cdbbd76a5dcf301a5f25726d24a8881f8e", "ja": "……ん？　あの声は……。", "zh": "……嗯？那个声音是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "7070190def13c4412a375ef7b2a1471a0563a5f6b085a50e7f343c5bb3fd40eb", "ja": "うぅ……と、届かない……。私の目には、はっきりと\n映っているのに……こんなに、遠いなんて……！", "zh": "呜……够、够不着……明明清清楚楚地映在我的眼里……没想到竟然离得这么远……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "40555430018a536ea695a194ce965acbf71b1d9d1729572e94eed438d6a4cee3", "ja": "うーん、やっぱり私たちじゃ届かないかぁ。\n脚立が必要ね。可憐手伝って。", "zh": "嗯——果然还是够不着啊。看来需要梯子呢。可怜，来帮我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "886e867dc3b62a8497b4c6722cc2ac28e3c8ce775be2620c6701fc160026438f", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です、律子さん！\n希望の光には、思いきり腕を伸ばせば……きっと……！", "zh": "不、不用担心，律子小姐！\n只要竭尽全力伸手去触碰希望之光……一定……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "1157c595788eb705620913fdb61c3f3f3174d1f674bc6366ffd8a68c22bea8aa", "ja": "ゆ、百合子ちゃん……！", "zh": "百、百合子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "05cd47e3b69ae87b7e06d39749a60cef0c569a3ebf7e7b7fe45fce38a23b8921", "ja": "あ、あとすこしなのに……うぅ……！", "zh": "啊，明明就差一点了……呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f8fd44c297c8e0157e6e59f795a222d93706e3c6b6a1b62b9db967e0f87437fd", "ja": "みんな、こんなところにいたのか。\nお疲れさま。", "zh": "大家原来都在这里啊。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "d2ada2691228dc1e2f34ea2f3a2ef11707a2243f293bd4930574060e2c121c8f", "ja": "あ、お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nナイスタイミングですね！", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，{$P$}。\n来得正是时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1017_p", "source_sha256": "95d3463a7b54f4b7e5861789b620cdfb269634634957ebde8ae3334281949761", "ja": "ナイスタイミングって？", "zh": "“正是好时机”是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "591ce781657bf5773a5bca8c211cb414b3625b7bd2a808221f17f0adae8240c2", "ja": "あうう……と、取れない～。", "zh": "啊呜呜……拿、拿不到～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bd5be17c29518fe4d9fe6dbde2c29efa9961245978e24a8cb3e3a366afb519c7", "ja": "あ、やっぱり百合子の声だったか。\nそれで、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "啊，果然是百合子的声音。\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "667375ea05a5eea27a26105b38db9cdb09ee180cbdf0830cd1248042ba8a68d3", "ja": "あ、あの棚の上に……資料と一緒に、\n百合子ちゃんの本が片付けられてしまって……。", "zh": "啊，那个架子上……和资料一起，\n百合子的书被收起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1020_p", "source_sha256": "84d919d2c8d217963d14af0b55723b40897e9215b671cdec58820855c4a81330", "ja": "えっと……あ、あの背表紙の厚い本が\n百合子のか？　どれどれ……。", "zh": "呃……那本书脊很厚的书，是百合子的？我看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_1021", "source_sha256": "bc0ca7f441a95e84b14ddb64e1fde7d69e9525a29f989dca7c69c02e3dd7db69", "ja": "本を取る", "zh": "取书", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0f661928529b41c7a42ece0a5acd76373988a98464afb9d0333588f84523e5d5", "ja": "……よしっ、取れた！", "zh": "……好，拿到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2001_026yur", "source_sha256": "8d0397bfe062972f603816253274af030365eab0e30156c1dd21a2c0691312bc", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございま……きゃあっ！！？", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……呀！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2002_026yur", "source_sha256": "3df8510638590bb4fd0eeaedff101df2c31794dcb8031b650ec1b6bb4871df5b", "ja": "あああ、あの、{$P$}さん！\nなんていうか……ち、近いです！！", "zh": "啊啊啊，那、那个，{$P$}先生！\n该怎么说呢……太、太近了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2003_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2004_026yur", "source_sha256": "fe50c426200bdc779c05e9932a6611998a69769cb707d9d0c51318aae3ebd7ad", "ja": "はっ！？　い、いえ、何でもありません！\n本、ありがとうございます……！", "zh": "哈！？不、不是，没什么！\n谢谢您的书……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2005_009rit", "source_sha256": "dd0918447668570bf15663c2ed94860d717102ebd9565fa292d80d454515e27d", "ja": "ふふっ。さすがですね、{$P$}殿！\n今の、恋愛小説のワンシーンみたいでしたよ？", "zh": "呵呵，不愧是您，{$P$}先生！\n刚才那一幕，简直就像恋爱小说中的场景一样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2006_045kar", "source_sha256": "a73c8cf5cd921fa8ba7c687bac927db71bbb3a35c2b4228a8b9a430d338a60e9", "ja": "わ、私も、ドキドキしてしまいました……。\nまるで、ヒロインが恋に落ちるシーンみたい……。", "zh": "我、我也心跳加速了……\n简直就像女主角坠入爱河的场景一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2007_p", "source_sha256": "a41f6536874a4e7fefc32d7e3930608566115dc491ac0c36d2a07900a744f375", "ja": "そ、そうか？　ただ本を取っただけなんだけど……\nというか、百合子に話があるんだけど。", "zh": "是、是吗？我只是拿了本书而已……\n话说，我有件事想跟百合子说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2008_026yur", "source_sha256": "146d539fa81fc2be4aa13c93e7d06a784748041231c65a863f10ea485bc4d24a", "ja": "は、はい！　あの、お話ってなんですか？\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "是、是的！那个，您找我有什么事？  \n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2009_p", "source_sha256": "8c20a0d0145072efbf31ccee83bb4f1abb672f646414f1c379ce8bf95f0fe65a", "ja": "うん。さっき、デモ音源が届いたんだけど……\n次の公演は、百合子に新曲を歌ってもらいたいんだ。", "zh": "嗯。刚才Demo音源送过来了……\n我想让百合子在下次公演上唱这首新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2010_026yur", "source_sha256": "ef1fcf5e84962fa0ce00601b0c36d2a95de2acb624941b24558ffabad8e075eb", "ja": "新曲……えっ？\n新曲って、わ、私のですか！？", "zh": "新歌……咦？\n新歌是、是我的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2011_009rit", "source_sha256": "3b56ed037b7f7ba6113607009be19432c556abade4329b959187ae0151d1ea4f", "ja": "よかったじゃない百合子！", "zh": "太好了，百合子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2012_045kar", "source_sha256": "d7d1195a0c66ce6ac25b7994ed00bb35b32d31c7c9c636556c4a1efe5e8b288a", "ja": "わぁ……ゆ、百合子ちゃんの新曲かぁ……♪\n{$P$}さん、どんな曲ですか……？", "zh": "哇……是、百合子的新歌啊……♪\n{$P$}先生，是首什么样的歌呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2013_p", "source_sha256": "437bc453d36ee8ce784b779956e55cc0eb30edfa7201b1bf52924b75a3d5673e", "ja": "せっかくだから、聞いてみるか？\nよし、控え室に戻ろうか。", "zh": "难得有机会，要不要听听看？\n好了，我们回休息室吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2014_026yur", "source_sha256": "74f5c3c7c10c57771fd2a8a435be5b388e6ddd6693feb8a793fdd47bb012db32", "ja": "は、はいっ！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2016_026yur", "source_sha256": "c238b39c60bd14845c916420508ae045cca0c3df5ec85d3cf3aa3c6ec5bb8c6c", "ja": "こ……これが、私の新しい曲……なんて爽やかな曲\nなんでしょう！　風の戦士に、ぴったりです！", "zh": "这……这就是我的新歌……多么清爽的歌曲啊！和风之战士太相配了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2017_009rit", "source_sha256": "06eeffc0d5fc523582e50166f7beecf6309a3211729e90f0fc5b654717dcbb72", "ja": "風の戦士かどうかは分からないけど、ふふ\n素敵な曲だと思うわ、百合子に合ってると思う。", "zh": "风之战士什么的我不太清楚，不过，呵呵，我觉得这是首很棒的歌，应该很适合百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2018_045kar", "source_sha256": "0a673d8ecc74c9948e4025729539a073140c0aee8505ab162e8fe8003c3cf179", "ja": "そうですね……百合子ちゃんが歌ったら、\nどんなふうになるのか……た、楽しみです……♪", "zh": "是啊……要是由百合子演唱的话，会是什么样子呢……我、我很期待……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2019_p", "source_sha256": "7200c490212d37a91c6a86919975d4dd160e7acf0cb9c76fb6328c135a44e576", "ja": "よし、決まりだな！　律子、可憐。\nふたりにも、公演のサポートをお願いできるか？", "zh": "好，就这么决定了！律子、可怜。也能拜托你们两位帮忙支持公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2020_009rit", "source_sha256": "61e37643a61a9583ea5b1083ffcae99959827249deaa31681ae2543a67e0fe2d", "ja": "まかせてください！\nしっかり、百合子をサポートして見せますよ。", "zh": "交给我吧！\n我一定会好好支持百合子的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2021_045kar", "source_sha256": "0fa95b81a8e11219e17a1277a9dd8b2f338691f9400e84bb3a2ecc7cb440c558", "ja": "はい……わ、私も、がんばります……！\nよろしくね、百合子ちゃん……♪", "zh": "好的……我、我也会加油的……！\n请多关照，百合子……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2022_026yur", "source_sha256": "f442d16206530ff74ea3fa5b8c5a5f86ac674f510d0454ae0f14565340d4f019", "ja": "こちらこそ！　おふたりがいると、心強いです！\nよろしくお願いしますね、律子さん、可憐さん♪", "zh": "我才要请你们多多关照！有你们两位在，我就放心多了！\n律子姐、可怜姐，请多多关照啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_065_2023_p", "source_sha256": "a5cd48d815719b012ca298baba72fb591e332c022be9c0095dce3382a96f0b0b", "ja": "（みんなの言うとおり、百合子に似合う曲だ。\nあとは、この曲の良さを活かせる公演にしないとな！）", "zh": "（正如大家所说，这是一首很适合百合子的歌。接下来得安排一场能发挥这首歌魅力的公演才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
